The repository includes scripts, metadata, organizational structures, and curated image files sourced from third-party platforms. The repository may include both Safe For Work (SFW) and Not Safe For Work (NSFW) content. The image content is not open source and remains subject to the rights of the original creators.

2. Prohibited Uses
You are expressly prohibited from:
- Removing or altering watermarks, signatures, or credit information embedded in or accompanying any image.
- Republishing, redistributing, or hosting the content from this repository on public platforms, websites, bots, mirrors, or imageboards without explicit permission.
